# 🧩 Main Components

### `frontend.py`

Handles:

- Streamlit interface
- PDF upload
- User questions
- Displaying responses

### `vector_database.py`

Handles:

- PDF ingestion
- Text extraction
- Text chunking
- Embedding generation
- FAISS vector storage

### `rag_pipeline.py`

Handles:

- Query processing
- Similarity retrieval
- Context construction
- LLM interaction
- Response generation

